# Dependencies (Bun hoists to root — cover nested too)
**/node_modules

# Next.js build output
**/.next

# Turbo cache
**/.turbo

# Git
.git
.gitignore

# Build artifacts
**/dist

# Cloudflare / Wrangler state
**/.wrangler

# Documentation — not needed at runtime
**/*.md

# Environment files — never bake secrets into images
**/.env*
